[hermes:err-live] ### milvus-io/milvus#51785 — enhance: single global schema.Version for QueryNode (remove barrier-ts / segcoreSchemaVersion); fix add_function_field reopen race (#51062)
[hermes:err-live] - State: `OPEN` · Closing-link from PR: no · Source: `cross`
[hermes:err-live] - URL: https://github.com/milvus-io/milvus/pull/51785
